{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1772650821,"nonce":"p7HfTtngV04llNojPmmPL9xRnZA=","title":"Switchboard tab: per-pairing ignore patterns with global defaults","message":"The switchboard should support gitignore-style ignore patterns to filter out files/dirs from sync operations.\n\n**Two levels:**\n1. **Global defaults** — set in Mandible app Settings tab; applied to every new pairing at creation time. Sensible defaults: `.DS_Store`, `.git/`, `node_modules/`, `__pycache__/`, `*.pyc`.\n2. **Per-pairing overrides** — can add/remove patterns for a specific sync pair.\n\nMigrated from dotfiles issue ae6bf39.","files":null}]}